Complete and unmitigated bilgewater-flavo(u)red drivel.

Spoiler warning:





























Nethack has *one* intrinsic called telepathy and doesn't have one called ESP.
Eating a floating eye gives you telepathy instrinsic. Wearing an amulet of ESP
gives you telepathy instrinsic. Wearing a helm of telepathy gives you telepathy
intrinsic, and *in addition* this works over a limited range when *not blind*
(when blind it works as normal).

An amulet of ESP *doesn't* allow you to see by telepathy when not blind. The
dev team use ESP and telepathy interchangably, so I feel free to do the same.

Please check your facts first in future, or add IMHO or AFAIR in front of
anything you say, especially when contradicting people. The above has all been
checked in Wizard mode on NetHack 3.0j, as I don't yet have 3.1.x.

Peace and light, folks.

